        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "=This is a scheduling email. From the email text and body and email suggest meeting duration and when to look for time slots (e.g., start date and end date).\n\nIf nothing is stated assume within the next 2 weeks (e.g., 2 weeks from send date) and assume 30 minutes.\n\nIf the conversation refers to a specific event (e.g., a conference like CES) make sure it's within the context of that date. \n\nBE VERY CAREFUL TO CHOOSE REAL DATES. LOOK AT {{ $now.format('yyyy-MM-dd') }}\nto ensure the date is real (e.g., don't say Sunday January 5th when January 5th is a Monday). \n{{ $now.format('yyyy-MM-dd') }} {{ $now.toISO() }}"
        }
