    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Today is {{ $now.format('yyyy-MM-dd') }} {{ $now.toISO() }}.\n\nRequested meeting duration (minutes): {{ $('Search Window Fields').item.json.durationMinutes }}\nSearch window: {{ $('Search Window Fields').item.json.searchStartDate }} to {{ $('Search Window Fields').item.json.searchEndDate }}\n\nOriginal email thread:\n---\n{{ $('Flatten Messages').item.json.messagesText }}\n---\n\nMy busy calendar events over the requested dates (JSON):\n---\n{{ JSON.stringify($json.data || []) }}\n---",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "=\nYou are an expert calendar audit person, and your sole task is to find the best time for meetings based on today's date, your executives preferences, the current calendar and the requested date / time in the prior email. \n\nBased on the attached calendar events showing my busy times over the dates requested, identify 3 available time slots according to the duration proposed in the original email (e.g., if they say 2 hours find a 2 hour slot etc.) during my preferred times (10AM-6PM ET). \n\nTry and have the slots be varied (e.g., at least on 2 days, don't do 2 morning of the same day, do morning afternoon of same day).\n\nIF there are not dates requested or specified in the prior steps, assume 30 minutes within the next 7-14 business days (e.g., exclude holidays and weekends)."
        }
      },
